        <ul>
          <li>Locks every physical key including F1–F12 and media keys.</li>
          <li>Animated bear that scrubs a keyboard while the lock is active.</li>
          <li>Mouse stays usable; unlock anytime via button or by holding Esc 3&nbsp;seconds.</li>
          <li>Display stays awake during cleaning.</li>
          <li>Menubar quick-lock action.</li>
          <li>Light / Dark / System appearance switchable in Settings.</li>
          <li>Seven languages: EN · DE · FR · ES · IT · JA · 简体中文.</li>
